{"version":1,"content":"<p>日本連續劇VIVANT第2季近日熱播，針對劇中出現中方人員對日方特務施以切指、刺穿腹部等劇情，官媒央視今天批評劇情顛倒黑白、刻意抹黑中國，還指這部劇美化日本海外行動。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:30.980668+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":83,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T13:40:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T14:08:20.525822+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:25.536546+00:00","content_hash":"18e602aac6e232754a7232e0dc05ef3dbfbd4097717d169d1b3cfd3e116fff71","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}